# Architectural term: a cornice is the horizontal band at the top of a facade. Literally "the band stuck to the top edge of the screen", and its codified proportions resonate naturally.
- Write project-style constraint text for CLAUDE.md

# prompt
 A status bar for a Linux Wayland environment, written in Rust. Its traits are simplicity, elegance and consistency, and the bar hosts a notification daemon in the same process.
 notify-send popups appear in the top-right, morphing out of the right-hand bar component, animated like an iOS Dynamic Island.

